{"ticker":"KROSS","symbol":"KROSS","instrumentId":3192224,"name":"Kross","industry":"NSE-Transportation-Equip Mfg","about":"Kross Limited is a specialized manufacturer of forged components catering to top OEMs and Tier 1 suppliers in India. It provides high-performance, safety-critical parts for commercial vehicles, tractors, and trailer axles. The company’s trailer segment offers axles, suspensions, landing gears, and king pins, built for higher durability and lower maintenance. In tractors, it supplies components used in hydraulic lift assemblies, rear axles, and front spindles. For medium and heavy trucks, it delivers components integrated into transmission systems, rear axles, steering assemblies, gear shifts, and chassis. Its advanced machining infrastructure ensures precision engineering for critical applications across transportation and agricultural sectors.","website":"www.krosslimited.com","location":null,"exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:36:59.663Z","basis":"standalone","price":{"value":286.1,"changePct":3.2292982139635744,"week52High":306.55,"week52Low":158.28},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹1,889 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹822 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"21,782,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"21"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"6,106,500"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.00%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"3.77"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"4"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"6.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.28"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.39"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"2%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"26.52"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"21–31"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"11.3%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"4.3"},{"label":"Volume","value":"312,600"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"2,318,656"},{"label":"Master score","value":"66"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"91"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"92"},{"label":"Group rank","